		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=22022#p22022"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="codebox"><pre><code>create table ma_table as select *, &#039;blabla&#039;::text as mon_champ from ......[ma selection]</code></pre></div><p>ou CAST pour être plus standard.</p>]]></content>
